[ti:Sseḥseb]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Tissirt n Ndama]
[length:6:27]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[01:24.32] Sseḥseb ad tafeḍ tḍelmeḍ
[01:28.45] Ɣef ass mi d i-tneɛmeḍ
[01:34.48] Ur tekkiḍ s anda nniḍen
[01:39.64] Taggara fell-i trewleḍ
[01:43.15] Annaɣ ur tḥebṛeḍ
[01:49.67] I teḍṣa n yiɛdawen
[01:54.58] Ass mi ara d-id sfeqḍeḍ
[01:58.42] Ur d i-d-tettafeḍ
[02:01.88] Di tebḥat n lemḥayen
[02:06.80] Xas tebɣiḍ ɣur-i ad d-tdewwṛeḍ
[02:10.86] Ad d-tafeḍ tayeḍ
[02:14.16] Deg umkan teǧǧiḍ yeḥzen
[02:19.37]
[02:30.92] Ass mi ara teɛyuḍ deg ucali
[02:35.00] Ad d-tberneḍ tikli
[02:40.96] Ad tafeḍ beddlen lecɣal
[02:45.83] Axxam-iw teǧǧiḍ yeɣli
[02:49.45] Ad d-tafeḍ yuli
[02:55.42] S tidi n lḥif d leḥlal
[03:00.58] Nndama ɣur-m ad d-teggri
[03:04.18] Ad kem tessemsawi
[03:07.86] D waṭṭan ad d-temǧamal
[03:12.64] Mi ara teḥṣuḍ
[03:14.30] Deg imi n lɣaci
[03:16.28] Yerna ɣur-i mmi
[03:19.98] Ttaɛebga s ifri ad am-tmal
[03:24.84]
[03:36.38] Ad tent-id-yejmeɛ wul-im
[03:40.43] Ad am-yenneḍ ɣer lɣim
[03:46.38] Wamma asigna kull ass
[03:51.12] Ad hedrent tizyiwin-im
[03:54.98] Mi d-bedren-t isem-im
[04:00.88] Ad as-qqarent teḍṛa-as
[04:05.80] Ciṭ ciṭ iɣebbu zzin-im
[04:09.19] Tacamat ad t-teqqim
[04:12.89] Ɣef udmim ad treṣṣi tilas
[04:17.70] Lmut ad tt-yeḍleb yiles-im
[04:21.35] Ad teddem leɛmer-im
[04:24.71] Ad tt-tebɣuḍ muḥal ad d-tas
[04:29.61] Lmut ad tt-yeḍleb yiles-im
[04:33.72] Ad teddem leɛmer-im
[04:36.88] Ad tt-tebɣuḍ muḥal ad d-tas
[04:41.11]
[05:41.97] Lmut ad tt-yeḍleb yiles-im
[05:45.85] Ad teddem leɛmer-im
[05:49.16] Ad tt-tebɣuḍ muḥal ad d-tas
[05:53.99] Lmut ad tt-yeḍleb yiles-im
[05:57.38] Ad teddem leɛmer-im
[06:00.88] Ad tt-tebɣuḍ muḥal ad d-tas
[06:05.78] Lmut ad tt-yeḍleb yiles-im
[06:09.34] Ad teddem leɛmer-im
[06:12.44] Ad tt-tebɣuḍ muḥal ad d-tas
